# UX workflow: capture current Macro surfaces for macro modulation UX planning.
# Purpose: provides real LVGL 320x240 references before designing motion recorder
# access, feedback, and edit overlays. This workflow does not exercise future
# modulation features.
# Expect: capture_changed:macro_edit_open=macro_edit_adjusted

0 scenario macro
50 capture screen macro_ready

# Performance value feedback.
150 encoder MACRO_1 0.75
250 capture screen macro_value_changed

# Macro edit overlay, currently Channel / CC.
350 button MACRO_1 down
1400 tick
1450 capture screen macro_edit_open
1500 button MACRO_1 up

# Existing row edit feedback.
1600 encoder NAV 1
1700 encoder OPT 0.50
1800 capture screen macro_edit_adjusted

1900 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2100 capture screen macro_edit_closed
